Backtesting
Use event-driven deterministic replay:
Historical data → market state → features → strategy → risk → simulated order → fill model → position → P&L.
Model:
brokerage
taxes/fees
spread
slippage
market impact
latency
partial fills
rejects
gaps
capacity
Validation:
train/test separation
walk-forward
parameter sensitivity
Monte Carlo/trade randomization
regime breakdown
cost sensitivity
capacity analysis
Never use future information to calculate a decision at timestamp T.
